&_nc_ss=7ba8c&oh=00_AQN2thjQ4NcH0n9tI5JXnU8qRN4O0JHf4QMf182GcSZNlg&oe=6ACDA442", "width": 640, "height": 640, "id": "9", "resolution": "640x640"}, {"url": "https://scontent-bog2-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/809201574_1779466239735988_6948637717689534150_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ig_cache_key=Mzk5MDYzNzkyMjM4MDkxNjI0MQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjY0MC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=8qAKkccnytwQ7kNvwEgzlzV&_nc_oc=AdpslcegRKk_X219wffML-HkzB76C-M9OmgigK8hvZ7JAIz6tGIES-r9QmwF0BBtybo&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-bog2-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=tb7aAR_izNElet8Lxkbdhw&_nc_ss=7ba8c&oh=00_AQMRWA9bvcimy3eZ6ZZRLsgaOJvkmg7f4SYiVmejVrA9lg&oe=6ACDA442", "width": 640, "height": 1136, "id": "10", "resolution": "640x1136"}], "comments": [{"author": "adoniasm_orales", "author_id": "585310512", "id": "18034136315897073", "text": "• 1. SPIN Selling – Neil Rackham\n• 2. Rompe la barrera del no (Never Split the Difference) – Chris Voss\n• 3. Secretos para cerrar la venta – Zig Ziglar\n• 4. Influencia: La psicología de la persuasión – Robert B. Cialdini\n• 5. Psicología de ventas – Brian Tracy\n• 6. Gap Selling – Keenan\n• 7. Fanatical Prospecting Sequences – Jeb Blount\n• 8. Vendes o vendes (Sell or Be Sold) – Grant Cardone\n• 9. El libro rojo del comerciante (visible por su portada característica y diseño de Jeffrey Gitomer)\n• 10. Cómo ganar amigos e influir sobre las personas – Dale Carnegie", "timestamp": 1791155433, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "dreams_rescue", "author_id": "9363847778", "id": "18109375094077181", "text": "La respuesta esta en las preguntas.. Allan Pease… te ensena a llevar el control de la venta… Atrevete a Rechazarme de Alice Wheaton… para mane jar objeciones como un professional!!!", "timestamp": 1791063560, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "fredyspineiro", "author_id": "5189670840", "id": "18000779652007797", "text": "Y por eso las personas no venden nada. El primer libro en la lista deberia ser “Como ganar amigos e influir a otras personas” pero por mucha diferencia.", "timestamp": 1790979391, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "sara_revodigital", "author_id": "23635923974", "id": "18035158100838534", "text": "Yo estoy empezando y quisiera saber. Cuál me recomiendan porque hasta ahorita voy bien creo :(", "timestamp": 1790912216, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "fabianruiz05", "author_id": "56517982769", "id": "18151580821541022", "text": "La biblia del vendedor de Alex Dey", "timestamp": 1790829994, "like_count": 4}, {"author": "kelydanitzapilcojulca", "author_id": "80402914811", "id": "18000614457006811", "text": "Gracias por la información ✨🤝", "timestamp": 1790690786, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "ronaldf_sg", "author_id": "2182648574", "id": "17909292756509830", "text": "El primero habrá en español??", "timestamp": 1790515751, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "edith.gyobeng", "author_id": "4251745717", "id": "17956786452016701", "text": "🔥el 2 es espectacular 👌", "timestamp": 1790225486, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "wilmerveliz05", "author_id": "10007281399", "id": "18081067235380379", "text": "Yo empezaría de atrás para adelante. No hay negociación alguna sin conexión con el prospecto🙌", "timestamp": 1790213744, "like_count": 4}, {"author": "renzoreateguibr", "author_id": "52608373913", "id": "18122611790493268", "text": "Que tan actualizados están y como afecta el paso del tiempo en esos libros?", "timestamp": 1790178987, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "javiervillarguti", "author_id": "176590329", "id": "18112726916037403", "text": "He leido vendes o vendes y psicología de ventas y justo hoy comienzo rompe la barrera del no 🙌", "timestamp": 1790164768, "like_count": 4}, {"author": "oscaramunozlo", "author_id": "18839960609", "id": "17908176963493286", "text": "Www.gerenciadeltiempo.com", "timestamp": 1790046296, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "willicaballero", "author_id": "3234470918", "id": "17905003635559778", "text": "Supere el  No en español es un libro excelente con una traducción pésima !", "timestamp": 1790036530, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "gabymedanich", "author_id": "5487878491", "id": "17939863389367385", "text": "Falta el libro negro del vendedor", "timestamp": 1790027745, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "axel.aromas", "author_id": "12418426797", "id": "17947348980314397", "text": "Que opinan de Vendele a la mente no a la gente de Jürgen Klaric", "timestamp": 1790017517, "like_count": 9}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DdhmAwOt6YR/?stkn=MXRwNG56M25pczFtcA==", "webpage_url_basename": "DdhmAwOt6YR", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://scontent-bog2-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/809201574_1779466239735988_6948637717689534150_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ig_cache_key=Mzk5MDYzNzkyMjM4MDkxNjI0MQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjY0MC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=8qAKkccnytwQ7kNvwEgzlzV&_nc_oc=AdpslcegRKk_X219wffML-HkzB76C-M9OmgigK8hvZ7JAIz6tGIES-r9QmwF0BBtybo&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-bog2-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=tb7aAR_izNElet8Lxkbdhw&_nc_ss=7ba8c&oh=00_AQMRWA9bvcimy3eZ6ZZRLsgaOJvkmg7f4SYiVmejVrA9lg&oe=6ACDA442", "display_id": "DdhmAwOt6YR", "fulltitle": "Video by franco.lulli", "upload_date": "20260920", "epoch": 1791484857, "url": "https://scontent-bog2-2.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQNwkGifCBeP8IwlwJvUd4rW3au9a6GTD2cPbkXg4GhqA13maoZUnNGtVEyZQc1aPDbExcUvU_FnQv9qaiaJ7eK7TkW-e1RlN7oNRRk.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-bog2-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=w4yXN_BiVYQQ7kNvwGv4Rtd&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MjUzNDcwMzkyMzYwODE4OCwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjE3LCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDA5OSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6MTAwLCJ1cmxnZW5fc291cmNlIjoid3d3In0%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=5c72321c7d2a9cca&_nc_&_nc_gid=tb7aAR_izNElet8Lxkbdhw&_nc_ss=7ba8